{"applicability_conditions":null,"identity":{"block_id":"b0042","equation_id":"equation_004","equation_number":"4","is_image":false,"latex_hint":"$$\nv _ {\\mathrm{climb}} = \\frac {D _ {0}}{k T} \\frac {G \\Omega}{\\pi (1 - \\nu) d _ {\\mathrm{d}}} \\exp \\left(\\frac {- Q _ {\\mathrm{c}}}{k T}\\right)\\tag{4}\n$$","paper_id":"10.1007_s11837-014-1032-x"},"latex":"v_{\\mathrm{climb}} = \\frac{D_{0}}{kT} \\frac{G\\Omega}{\\pi(1-\\nu)d_{\\mathrm{d}}} \\exp\\left(\\frac{-Q_{\\mathrm{c}}}{kT}\\right)","purpose":"计算位错攀移速度（dislocation climb velocity），该速度用于位错密度演化方程（式3）中描述位错通过攀移发生湮灭的项。","symbols":[{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"位错攀移速度（dislocation climb velocity）","symbol":"v_{\\mathrm{climb}}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"自扩散系数（self-diffusion coefficient）","symbol":"D_{0}","unit":"m² s⁻¹","value":"4.0 × 10⁻⁵"},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"玻尔兹曼常数（Boltzmann constant）","symbol":"k","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"绝对温度（absolute temperature）","symbol":"T","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"剪切模量（shear modulus）","symbol":"G","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"攀移激活体积（activation volume for climb）","symbol":"\\Omega","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"圆周率（pi）","symbol":"\\pi","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"泊松比（Poisson ratio）","symbol":"\\nu","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"可形成偶极子的两个位错之间的最大滑移面间距（maximum glide plane spacing two dislocations can have to form a dipole）","symbol":"d_{\\mathrm{d}}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"空位形成与迁移能（vacancy formation and migration energy）","symbol":"Q_{\\mathrm{c}}","unit":null,"value":null}],"unmapped":["在 [b0043] 中，“m is the Poisson ratio” 疑似为 OCR 错误，实际应对应式中的 ν（泊松比）；“X is the activation volume for climb” 疑似为 OCR 错误，实际应对应式中的 Ω（攀移激活体积）。","攀移速度 v_climb 用于式 (3) 中的位错密度演化项 -2ρ_d v_climb/(d_d - d_a)。","d_d 由式 (5) 计算：d_d = Gb / [8π(1 - ν)τ_eff,W]。"]}